ME:</span> Turn this option on.</p></div><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Once you've entered everything, scroll down and click the green <span class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Create repository</span> button.</p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Your repository should then open with a URL similar to:</p><p class="TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><code class="Code-mbuvRp" data-d-component="code">https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/BDA400-Assignment-6</code></p><h3 class="TextBase-qM5iDq Title-mwq_Iy" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">Tell me when you've completed this step.</h3><div class="Box-IGz62a" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-border="" style="border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><div role="radiogroup" aria-required="false" class="RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-sFHFZn" data-direction="col" aria-label="Options" data-d-component="radio-group" tabindex="0" style="outline: none;"><div class="flex" data-d-component="radio"><label for="done-_r_1d6_" class="RadioLabel-aEyICO"><div class="RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" data-state="checked" value="done" id="done-_r_1d6_" class="RadioItem-eqbQKh" tabindex="-1" data-radix-collection-item=""><span data-state="checked" class="RadioIndicator-QSL7RM"></s